# Placeholder so plugins/ exists in the tree.
#
# Git cannot track an empty directory, and the promotion workflow in
# drata/ai-plugins copies into plugins/<plugin> with `cp -R`, which creates the
# plugin directory but not this parent. Without this file that first copy fails
# with "cp: cannot create directory 'plugins/<plugin>': No such file or directory".
#
# Delete once a promoted plugin directory lives here.
